[b]Skip Space Travel — development draft[/b]

This project currently contains repository setup only. Travel skipping is not
implemented or game-tested, and there is no installable release or Nexus listing.

[b]Intended behavior[/b]
[list]
[*]Skip the repeated departure, hyperspace, and approach scenes before missions.
[*]Skip the corresponding three return scenes after missions.
[*]Preserve mission loading, results, rewards, and input restoration.
[*]Leave unrelated story scenes and conversations unchanged.
[/list]

Actual loading time cannot be removed by skipping cinematics.

